{"id":"vod_md_2471","vodId":"2471","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"学生会的一己之见","name_cn":"学生会的一己之见","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230815-1/4bbc53e6b9076cd7c8c80a8a68530d80.jpg"},"summary":"私立碧阳学园的学生会，可以说集结了这个学校最美丽最聪明的女生。身材娇小、天马行空的樱野栗梦（本多真梨子 配音）经常突发奇想，召开各种讨论会，可是在军师兼毒舌的抖S红叶知弦（齐藤佑圭 配音）、超级热爱漫画的阳光女孩椎名深夏（富樫美铃 配音）、阴柔温顺的椎名真冬（堀中优希 配音）等成员的掺合下，会议内容经常歪倒天涯海角去。学生会的唯一男性副会长杉崎键（近藤隆 配音），暗藏着建立伟大后宫的梦想纵横捭阖，各路出击。而通过他之手，学生会有趣好玩的一面也被真是地记录下来。本片根据葵关南（作）、狗神煌（画）创作的轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-15 07:45:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/axfPjXbe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/SRciuGCS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/pLs4WuLD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/Fyl2rdVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/G0pwQZVO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/KXfr4bTI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/If3yHWO9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/8G14dgrm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/c7HGDjRX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/GMRtCH0o/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/dmBqxHcm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/4oXPjtsK/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:41:48.869Z"}